Using environment: test
Usage: openbuff run [options] <prompt...>

Run an agent non-interactively on a prompt and exit (headless/CI mode)

Arguments:
  prompt               Prompt to send to the agent

Options:
  --json               Emit machine-readable events (one JSON object per line)
                       on stdout
  --agent <id>         Run a specific agent id (default: base)
  --timeout <seconds>  Abort the run after this many seconds (default: no
                       timeout)
  -h, --help           display help for command
